        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>你能接受孩子的平庸吗？</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    max-width: 552px;\n  }\n  .topbar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 14px 16px 10px 12px;\n  }\n  .back {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    color: #333;\n    line-height: 1;\n    width: 26px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .topbar .title {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .write {\n    color: #1772F6;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    margin-right: 14px;\n  }\n  .write .icon { margin-right: 4px; }\n  .dots {\n    color: #333;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .content {\n    padding: 18px 20px 0 20px;\n  }\n  .content p {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 1.72;\n    margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .highlight span {\n    background: #FBE0E0;\n  }\n  .searchmark {\n    color: #175199;\n  }\n  .magnifier {\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    vertical-align: super;\n  }\n  .meta {\n    padding: 0 20px;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .share {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 14px 18px 22px 18px;\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n  .share-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    border: 1px solid #e2e2e2;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 6px 14px 6px 8px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  .share-item .placeholder {\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    font-size: 0;\n  }\n  .ic-wechat { background: #4FBE45; }\n  .ic-moments { background: linear-gradient(135deg,#f4c500,#e8492e 50%,#2a7de1); }\n  .ic-qq { background: #4FC3F7; }\n  .ic-pic { background: #1772F6; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"back\">&#8249;</div>\n  <div class=\"title\">你能接受孩子的平庸吗？</div>\n  <div class=\"write\"><span class=\"icon\">&#9998;</span>写回答</div>\n  <div class=\"dots\">&#8943;</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content\">\n  <p>以上是我最近在读的一本书，作家<span class=\"searchmark\">刘继荣</span><span class=\"magnifier\">&#9906;</span><br>\n  《坐在路边鼓掌的人》里面讲的小故事。</p>\n\n  <p class=\"highlight\"><span>天下有多少雄心勃勃的父母，奢望自己的孩</span><br>\n  <span>子既能做顶天立地的栋梁，又能开繁花结硕</span><br>\n  <span>果。我们的欲望有多深，孩子就有多累。</span></p>\n\n  <p>如果孩子能自己找到出路，快乐与成就兼得，如果能平庸而幸福地过一生，父母又何必强求。</p>\n\n  <p>如果他们健康、快乐，如果那是他们想要的生活，我们的孩子，又何妨做一个普通人。</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"meta\">编辑于 2023-03-03 10:44 &middot; IP 属地江苏</div>\n\n<div class=\"share\">\n  <div class=\"share-item\"><span class=\"placeholder ic-wechat\">[Icon: WeChat]</span>微信</div>\n  <div class=\"share-item\"><span class=\"placeholder ic-moments\">[Icon: Moments]</span>朋友圈</div>\n  <div class=\"share-item\"><span class=\"placeholder ic-qq\">[Icon: QQ]</span>QQ</div>\n  <div class=\"share-item\"><span class=\"placeholder ic-pic\">[Icon: Image share]</span>图片分享</div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
